00:05:11.689 --> 00:05:12.118
[G


00:05:12.118 --> 00:05:12.549
[GM


00:05:12.549 --> 00:05:12.978
[GMT


00:05:12.978 --> 00:05:13.408
[GMTe


00:05:13.408 --> 00:05:13.838
[GMTea


00:05:13.838 --> 00:05:14.266
